from each other's hometown.

00:00:09.895 --> 00:00:11.242
- I'm from the Midwest.

00:00:11.242 --> 00:00:12.565
Cincinnati, Ohio represent.

00:00:12.565 --> 00:00:14.121
- Now, me, being from Virginia which

00:00:14.121 --> 00:00:17.093
is the East Coast,
a.k.a. I guess the South.

00:00:17.093 --> 00:00:19.113
They're gonna have a lot to live up to.

00:00:19.113 --> 00:00:21.296
- And being from San Diego, California.

00:00:21.296 --> 00:00:22.758
Pretty sure I got this one in the bag.

00:00:22.758 --> 00:00:24.340
So, I think we need to make a little bit

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:25.710
