00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:27.429
- Wait, no this is not a contest.

00:00:27.429 --> 00:00:28.775
- [Voiceover] Yes, this is a contest.

00:00:28.775 --> 00:00:30.075
- No, this is a bonding experience for

00:00:30.075 --> 00:00:31.329
the Feast Mode Hunger Squad.

00:00:31.329 --> 00:00:32.258
- It's a contest.

00:00:32.258 --> 00:00:33.821
- [Voiceover] No, Freddie
it's not a contest.

00:00:33.821 --> 00:00:34.812
Back me up here.

00:00:34.812 --> 00:00:37.157
- Steven, Ohio ain't got nothin' on me.

00:00:37.157 --> 00:00:38.833
- You're worried you're
gonna lose, aren't you?

00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:40.156
