00:00:40.156 --> 00:00:41.962
(upbeat music)

00:00:44.545 --> 00:00:45.984
- [Voiceover] Woo!

00:00:45.984 --> 00:00:47.726
- So, we're on our way
to Ricky's Fish Tacos

00:00:47.726 --> 00:00:48.794
in East Hollywood.

00:00:48.794 --> 00:00:49.792
It's a truck.

00:00:49.792 --> 00:00:50.818
We get to sit outside,

00:00:50.818 --> 00:00:52.629
enjoy this beautiful
Southern California day.

00:00:52.629 --> 00:00:54.138
- [Voiceover] Doesn't he have
like a million taco trucks?

00:00:54.138 --> 00:00:55.021
- No.

00:00:55.021 --> 00:00:56.739
He's got one because
he's a man of quality.

00:00:56.739 --> 00:00:58.573
- I respect that he's a monogamist.

00:00:58.573 --> 00:01:00.524
Are you a one man kinda girl?

00:01:00.524 --> 00:01:02.845
- [Voiceover] I am, I'm
a one man kind of girl.

00:01:06.212 --> 00:01:07.211
- [Voiceover] How are you?

00:01:07.211 --> 00:01:08.017
- How you guys doing?

00:01:08.017 --> 00:01:09.490
- This is Ricky of Ricky's Fish Tacos.

00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:11.092
Where did you learn to make fish tacos?

00:01:11.092 --> 00:01:12.764
- I've been eating them
since I was a little kid.

00:01:12.764 --> 00:01:14.297
You know, mom from Ensenada.

00:01:14.297 --> 00:01:15.806
They know how to make fish tacos.

00:01:15.806 --> 00:01:18.615
- We are going to eat a
lot of your fish tacos.

00:01:18.615 --> 00:01:19.800
- [Voiceover] All right.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:20.694
- Okay, thanks.

00:01:20.694 --> 00:01:23.259
I literally ate fish
tacos every single day

00:01:23.259 --> 00:01:25.047
after baseball practice with my dad.

00:01:25.047 --> 00:01:26.463
- Let's eat these tacos.

00:01:26.463 --> 00:01:28.925
I will say, I am the most
excited about this mayo sauce.

00:01:28.925 --> 00:01:30.248
Oh, I don't even know if you want this.

00:01:30.248 --> 00:01:31.877
Do you want this?
- [Steven] I guess I do now.

00:01:31.877 --> 00:01:32.992
- [All] Cheers.

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.524
- Whoa! Your hair.

00:01:34.524 --> 00:01:36.126
Can we get a replay on her hair trying

00:01:36.126 --> 00:01:37.218
to eat my food?

00:01:37.218 --> 00:01:38.355
(growl)

00:01:38.355 --> 00:01:39.609
- [Voiceover] Mmm.

00:01:39.609 --> 00:01:40.515
- Wow.

00:01:40.515 --> 00:01:42.001
- Ricky's gets extra points because he put

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:43.371
a surfboard in his logo.

00:01:43.371 --> 00:01:44.624
He gets two points for that.

00:01:44.624 --> 00:01:46.343
- Ricky also gets two
points for that fedora.

00:01:46.343 --> 00:01:48.339
- Ricky gets five points
for just keeping it simple.

00:01:48.339 --> 00:01:49.593
- That's the thing about tacos,

00:01:49.593 --> 00:01:50.870
it's really all about the meat.

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:51.915
Look at that ratio.

00:01:51.915 --> 00:01:53.564
- Let's give Ricky three points for having

00:01:53.564 --> 00:01:54.353
quality tortillas.

00:01:54.353 --> 00:01:55.727
- Three points for the crunch.

00:01:55.727 --> 00:01:56.819
- You love crunch.

00:01:56.819 --> 00:01:58.397
- I love crunch like you love ratios.

00:01:58.397 --> 00:01:59.744
- All his sauces are on point.

00:01:59.744 --> 00:02:01.021
- Plus one per sauce.

00:02:01.021 --> 00:02:02.557
Boom. Boom. Boom. Boom.

00:02:02.557 --> 00:02:04.485
And a solid four points
for the atmosphere.

00:02:04.485 --> 00:02:06.806
- Even the patrons are just super diverse.

00:02:06.806 --> 00:02:08.664
Everyone who's here at this truck on their

00:02:08.664 --> 00:02:10.150
lunch break, they look like they come from

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:11.288
all walks of life.

00:02:11.288 --> 00:02:13.285
- Three points to the three specs of food

00:02:13.285 --> 00:02:15.049
that are left on Colin's mustache,

00:02:15.049 --> 00:02:15.885
right now.

00:02:15.885 --> 00:02:17.209
- [Voiceover] The flavor saver.

00:02:17.209 --> 00:02:19.113
- I hope you guys got a
good fish taco experience.

00:02:19.113 --> 00:02:20.227
You enjoyed it.

00:02:20.227 --> 00:02:21.342
- Yep, I--

00:02:21.342 --> 00:02:22.479
- It was okay.

00:02:22.479 --> 00:02:24.314
- I'm trying to save
room for the next spot.

00:02:24.314 --> 00:02:26.682
We're gonna have some amazing B-B-Q.

00:02:26.682 --> 00:02:29.120
- [Colin] Oh.
- [Steven] Oh, snap.

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:30.513
- We're heading to my spot.

00:02:30.513 --> 00:02:32.324
It's known for its like
Texas style barbecue,

00:02:32.324 --> 00:02:34.135
and I'm not from Texas, I'm from Virginia,

00:02:34.135 --> 00:02:36.550
but I would say that's
the closest you can get

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.013
