00:03:33.970 --> 00:03:35.387
Major flavor points right here.

00:03:35.387 --> 00:03:36.664
We're giving him five, five flavor points.

00:03:36.664 --> 00:03:37.639
- Yeah, three points for the tender.

00:03:37.639 --> 00:03:38.799
- [Voiceover] Three!
- [Voiceover] Three!

