this place nailed it.

00:04:16.191 --> 00:04:17.375
Plus 17 points.

00:04:17.375 --> 00:04:18.444
- Okay.

00:04:18.444 --> 00:04:19.914
There's gotta be some order.
- [Freddie] No.

00:04:19.914 --> 00:04:22.274
